{
  "name": "duty-schedule-system",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "值班排班管理系统：可视化日历排班 + 中国法定节假日识别 + 钉钉定时提醒 + 值班记录归档统计",
  "main": "workday.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start:reminder": "node workday.js",
    "start:editor": "node file-editor.js",
